        "description": {
          "text": "Updated overall survival data for the PACIFIC trial and modified the Immunogenicity section; no new indication or population added",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for updates to the overall survival data for the PACIFIC trial (14.2) and modifications to the Adverse Reactions, Immunogenicity (6.2) section of the package insert to remove the statement regarding assay performance and clarify the source of the data for immunogenicity. This sBLA also contained the final study report for PMC 3329-01 cited in our approval letter for sBLA 760169/S-002, issued February 16, 2018. Finally, this sBLA relied on previously submitted data contained in your June 29, 2018, amendment containing the final study report for PMC 3205-05 cited in our approval letter for BLA 761069, issued May 1, 2017, in support of your proposed labeling changes to Section 6.2 of the package insert.",
